---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | SplitsWorkout"
  description="Terms and conditions for using SplitsWorkout.com — the free workout split and exercise guide platform."
  canonical="/terms"
  currentPage="about"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Terms & Conditions' }]}
>
<div class="page-header" style="margin-top:32px;">
  <h1 class="page-title">Terms & Conditions</h1>
  <p class="page-desc">Straightforward terms for using SplitsWorkout.</p>
</div>
<div class="content-layout">
  <article class="content-main">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Acceptance</h2>
      <p>By using SplitsWorkout.com you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

      <h2>What SplitsWorkout Provides</h2>
      <p>SplitsWorkout provides free fitness information including workout split guides, exercise instructions, muscle anatomy references, fitness calculators, and a workout builder tool. All content is provided for informational and educational purposes.</p>

      <h2>Medical Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>SplitsWorkout is not a medical service. Content on this site is not medical advice and does not substitute for consultation with a qualified healthcare professional. Before starting a new exercise programme, especially if you have any health conditions, injuries, or concerns, consult your doctor or a qualified fitness professional. Use all exercise information at your own risk.</p>

      <h2>Accuracy Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>We make reasonable efforts to ensure information is accurate and up to date. However, exercise science evolves and individual circumstances vary. We do not guarantee that any programme or exercise on this site will produce specific results. Always apply good judgment and listen to your body.</p>

      <h2>Permitted Use</h2>
      <p>You may use SplitsWorkout for personal, educational, and commercial purposes. You may link to SplitsWorkout pages freely. You may reference our content in articles and blog posts with attribution.</p>

      <h2>Prohibited Use</h2>
      <p>You may not reproduce or republish SplitsWorkout's written content, design, or code on other websites without permission. You may not scrape the site in a way that disrupts service. You may not use the site for any unlawful purpose.</p>

      <h2>Workout Builder</h2>
      <p>The Workout Builder stores data locally in your browser. We are not responsible for loss of data if you clear your browser storage. Custom workouts are not backed up to any server.</p>

      <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>Some pages on SplitsWorkout may contain affiliate links to fitness equipment. If you purchase through these links, we may earn a small commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate relationships do not influence our content recommendations.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>SplitsWorkout is provided "as is" without warranties. We are not liable for injuries, losses, or damages arising from use of information on this site. Exercise involves inherent risk — you accept this risk by using the site.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms. Updated terms are posted on this page. Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>
</Layout>
